# Gateway base URL (no trailing slash).
#
# Development (.env.development):
#   Leave empty to route /api via Vite dev-server proxy (default target http://localhost:8080).
#   Or set explicitly to call the gateway directly (gateway must allow CORS).
#
# Production / Staging:
#   Set to the environment gateway URL, e.g. https://api.luminova.com
VITE_GATEWAY_URL=
